4e12/(2×71×0.45×0.81)\n计算分母：2×71=142; 142×0.45=63.9; 63.9×0.81≈51.759\nt_prefill=594e12 /51.759e12 ≈ 594/51.759≈11.476秒\n\nt_decode = 655×(W_bytes +n×24.7)/(n_cards×BW_peak×0.8×0.81)\nW_bytes=14，n=1，n_cards=2，BW_peak=936\n分子：655×(14+24.7)=655×38.7≈25348.5\n分母：2×936×0.8×0.81=2×936=1872; 1872×0.8=1497.6; 1497.6×0.81≈1213.056\nt_decode≈25348.5 /1213.056≈20.896秒\nt_task = t_prefill + t_decode/n =11.476 +20.896/1≈32.372秒\nλ_raw=3600/32.372≈111.2 task/h\n\nc_pass =0.2600/(0.35×111.2×0.68)×100\n分母：0.35×111.2≈38.92; 38.92×0.68≈26.4656\nc_pass≈0.2600/26.4656×100≈0.009824×100≈0.9824 ¢/task\n\n接下来计算其他配置，比如RTX 3090 4卡W4（n=2）：\ngpu_price=1050×4=4200\n摊销=(4200+2000-0.4×4200)/26280=(6200-1680)/26280=4520/26280≈0.1720\n电费=(4×350+300)/1000×0.12=(1400+300)/1000×0.12=1.7×0.12=0.204\n故障=0.2×4200/26280=840/26280≈0.0320\nc_hour=0.172+0.204+0.032=0.408 $/h\n\nt_prefill=594e12/(4×71×0.45×0.81)\n分母：4×71=284; 284×0.45=127.8; 127.8×0.81≈103.518\nt_prefill≈594/103.518≈5.738秒\n\nt_decode=655×(14 +2×24.7)/(4×936×0.8×0.81)\n分子：655×(14+49.4)=655×63.4≈41527\n分母：4×936=3744; 3744×0.8=2995.2; 2995.2×0.81≈2426.112\nt_decode≈41527/2426.112≈17.116秒\nt_task=5.738 +17.116/2=5.738+8.558=14.296秒\nλ_raw=3600/14.296≈251.8 task/h\n\nc_pass=0.408/(0.35×251.8×0.68)×100\n分母：0.35×251.8≈88.13; 88.13×0.68≈59.9284\nc_pass≈0.408/59.9284×100≈0.006808×100≈0.6808 ¢/task\n\n再算V100 2卡W4：\ngpu_price=704×2=1408\n摊销=(1408+2000-0.4×1408)/26280=(3408-563.2)/26280=2844.8/26280≈0.1082\n电费=(2×250+300)/1000×0.12=(500+300)/1000×0.12=0.8×0.12=0.096\n故障=0.2×1408/26280=281.6/26280≈0.0107\nc_hour=0.1082+0.096+0.0107≈0.2149 $/h\n\nt_prefill=594e12/(2×125×0.45×0.81)\n分母：2×125=250; 250×0.45=112.5; 112.5×0.81≈91.125\nt_prefill≈594/91.125≈6.518秒\n\nt_decode=655×(14+24.7)/(2×900×0.8×0.81)\n分子：655×38.7≈25348.5\n分母：2×900=1800; 1800×0.8=1440; 1440×0.81=1166.4\nt_decode≈25348.5/1166.4≈21.73秒\nt_task=6.518 +21.73/1≈28.248秒\nλ_raw=3600/28.248≈127.4 task/h\n\nc_pass=0.2149/(0.35×127.4×0.68)×100\n分母：0.35×127.4≈44.59; 44.59×0.68≈30.3212\nc_pass≈0.2149/